1. What ReelSmith is
ReelSmith is a desktop application that helps you create short narrated videos and publish them to your own social media accounts, including TikTok. It runs on your own computer.
• Connecting TikTok. You connect your TikTok account through TikTok's official sign-in (Login Kit). ReelSmith never sees or stores your TikTok password.
• Posting. ReelSmith uses TikTok's Content Posting API to upload a video to your account only when you choose a video, review its caption and privacy settings, and press Post. It never posts automatically.
• Who operates it. ReelSmith is an independent application. It is not made, endorsed or sponsored by TikTok, ByteDance or any other platform it connects to.
